{
  "name": "Helpdesk D: New item record sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D: New item record → Google Sheets (tab: Item Transfers)\n1. Edit **Config**: paste your Spreadsheet ID. Keep sheetName `Item Transfers` (or the tab you created).\n2. Attach credentials: Webhook = Header Auth (name `X-Webhook-Secret`, same secret as workflows A and B), Google Sheets nodes = Google Service Account.\n3. Never change **Cell Format** from RAW.\n4. Activate, then copy the PRODUCTION webhook URL into N8N_TRANSFER_CREATED_WEBHOOK_URL.\nSee n8n/README.md.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "a5a2021c-697f-50bd-9eaf-79be3d459614",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
